WEBVTT

00:00:11.996 --> 00:00:14.260
[ DOOR OPENS,
INDISTINCT CONVERSATIONS ]

00:00:14.303 --> 00:00:16.044
MY FATHER
WILLHEAR ABOUT THIS.

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:23.269
Neville:
HEY, LOSERS...

00:00:23.312 --> 00:00:26.228
HE ISN'T HERE.

00:00:38.414 --> 00:00:42.288
AS YOUR NEW
MINISTER FOR MAGIC,

00:00:42.331 --> 00:00:47.293
I PROMISE TO RESTORE
THIS TEMPLE OF TOLERANCE

00:00:47.336 --> 00:00:49.469
TO ITS FORMER GLORY.

00:00:49.512 --> 00:00:52.689
THEREFORE,
BEGINNING TODAY,

00:00:52.733 --> 00:00:58.086
EACH EMPLOYEE
WILL SUBMIT THEMSELVES...

00:00:58.129 --> 00:01:00.567
FOR EVALUATION.

00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:04.353
BUT KNOW THIS --
YOU HAVE NOTHING TO FEAR

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:07.487
IF YOU HAVE NOTHING TO HIDE.

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:10.446
[ GIGGLES ]

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:13.406
[ INDISTINCT CONVERSATIONS ]

00:01:15.538 --> 00:01:18.280
Man: SNATCHERS!Snatcher #1:
MOVE OUT OF THE WAY!

00:01:18.324 --> 00:01:20.891
[ INDISTINCT SHOUTING ]

00:01:20.935 --> 00:01:24.330
GET OUT!

00:01:24.373 --> 00:01:27.158
Snatcher #2: YOU!

00:01:27.202 --> 00:01:30.684
[ SHOUTING CONTINUES ]

00:01:30.727 --> 00:01:33.426
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:01:33.469 --> 00:01:35.819
[ DISCORDANT NOTES PLAY ]

00:01:35.863 --> 00:01:38.126
[ CHUCKLING ]
IT'S -- BE A BIT GENTLER.

00:01:38.169 --> 00:01:41.303
[ DISCORDANT NOTES PLAY ]

00:01:41.347 --> 00:01:44.915
[ "FUR ELISE" PLAYS ]

00:01:49.137 --> 00:01:52.009
[ DISCORDANT NOTES PLAY ]

00:01:57.624 --> 00:01:59.277
[ PLAYING STOPS ]

00:01:59.321 --> 00:02:03.412
[ STATIC,
INDISTINCT TALKING ON RADIO ]

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:06.546
THEY HAVE
FLESH MEMORIES.

00:02:06.589 --> 00:02:09.940
WHEN SCRIMGEOUR
FIRST GAVE IT TO YOU,

00:02:09.984 --> 00:02:14.336
I THOUGHT IT MIGHT OPEN
AT YOUR TOUCH...

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:17.470
THAT DUMBLEDORE HAD HIDDEN
SOMETHING INSIDE IT.

00:02:17.513 --> 00:02:19.428
MANY OF YOU ARE WONDERING...

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:20.777
[ BANGING ]

00:02:20.821 --> 00:02:22.300
...NOW THAT HE HAS VANQUISHED

00:02:22.344 --> 00:02:24.346
THE MOST POWERFUL SYMBOL
OF OPPOSITION

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:25.695
TO HIM AND HIS FOLLOWERS.

00:02:27.523 --> 00:02:29.046
[ Muffled ]
GET OFF!

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:31.745
HARRY POTTER...
SO LONG IT'S BEEN!

00:02:31.788 --> 00:02:33.529
GET OFF ME!

00:02:33.573 --> 00:02:37.185
[ GRUNTING ]

00:02:37.228 --> 00:02:38.969
[ DISHES CLATTER ]

00:02:39.013 --> 00:02:43.104
AS REQUESTED, KREACHER
HAS RETURNED WITH THE THIEF,

00:02:43.147 --> 00:02:45.280
MUNDUNGUS FLETCHER.EXPELLIARMUS!

00:02:45.323 --> 00:02:46.716
WHAT YOU
PLAYING AT,

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:48.718
SETTING A PAIR
OF BLEEDING HOUSE ELVES ONTO ME?

00:02:48.762 --> 00:02:50.677
DOBBY WAS ONLY TRYING
TO HELP.

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:52.896
DOBBY SAW KREACHER
IN DIAGON ALLEY,

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.985
WHICH DOBBY THOUGHT
WAS CURIOUS,

00:02:55.029 --> 00:02:59.337
A-AND THEN DOBBY HEARD KREACHER
MENTION HARRY POTTER'S NAME.

00:02:59.381 --> 00:03:02.210
I HAD TO --AND THEN DOBBY
SAW KREACHER

00:03:02.253 --> 00:03:03.777
TALKING
WITH THE THIEF,

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:05.474
MUNDUNGUS --I'M NO THIEF!

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:08.434
YOU FOUL, LITTLE...
GIT.

00:03:08.477 --> 00:03:10.436
I'M A PURVEYOR OF...

00:03:10.479 --> 00:03:12.699
RARE AND WONDROUS
OBJECTS.

00:03:12.742 --> 00:03:15.005
YOU'RE A THIEF, DUNG.
EVERYONE KNOWS IT.

00:03:15.049 --> 00:03:16.529
MASTER WEASLEY...

00:03:16.572 --> 00:03:18.922
SO GOOD
TO SEE YOU AGAIN.

00:03:18.966 --> 00:03:21.751
WICKED TRAINERS.[ CLATTERING ]

00:03:21.795 --> 00:03:24.101
LISTEN, I PANICKED THAT NIGHT,
ALL RIGHT?

00:03:24.145 --> 00:03:25.668
[ GRUNTS ]

00:03:25.712 --> 00:03:27.931
CAN I HELP IT IF MAD-EYE
FELL OFF HIS BROOM?

00:03:29.846 --> 00:03:31.413
YOU...TELL THE TRUTH.

00:03:31.457 --> 00:03:33.633
WHEN YOU TURNED THIS PLACE
OVER -- DON'T DENY IT --

00:03:33.676 --> 00:03:36.070
YOU FOUND A LOCKET,
AM I RIGHT?

00:03:36.113 --> 00:03:38.072
WHY?
WAS IT VALUABLE?

00:03:38.115 --> 00:03:39.769
Hermione:
YOU'VE STILL GOT IT?

00:03:39.813 --> 00:03:41.771
NO, HE'S WORRIED HE DIDN'T
GET ENOUGH MONEY FOR IT.

00:03:41.815 --> 00:03:44.252
BLEEDING GIVE IT AWAY,
DIDN'T I?

00:03:44.295 --> 00:03:46.254
[ SIGHS ]
THERE I WAS...

00:03:46.297 --> 00:03:48.430
FLOGGING ME WARES
IN DIAGON ALLEY

00:03:48.474 --> 00:03:51.912
WHEN SOME MINISTRY HAG COMES UP
AND ASKS TO SEE ME LICENSE.

00:03:51.955 --> 00:03:54.044
SAYS SHE'S A MIND
TO LOCK ME UP.

00:03:54.088 --> 00:03:55.611
AND WOULD'VE DONE, TOO,

00:03:55.655 --> 00:03:58.701
IF SHE HADN'T HAVE TAKEN A FANCY
TO THAT LOCKET.

00:03:58.745 --> 00:04:01.269
WHO WAS SHE, THE WITCH?
DO YOU KNOW?

00:04:01.312 --> 00:04:02.923
NO, I...

00:04:07.362 --> 00:04:09.233
WELL, SHE'S THERE.

00:04:09.277 --> 00:04:12.367
LOOK.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.717
BLEEDING BOW AND ALL.

00:04:40.134 --> 00:04:41.570
[ SIGHS ]

00:04:50.971 --> 00:04:53.060
[ SNORING ]

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:56.933
RIGHT.

00:04:56.977 --> 00:04:58.326
[ SIGHS ]

00:04:58.369 --> 00:05:00.458
REMEMBER WHAT WE SAID.

00:05:00.502 --> 00:05:04.462
DON'T SPEAK TO ANYONE
UNLESS ABSOLUTELY NECESSARY.

00:05:04.506 --> 00:05:06.682
JUST TRY
AND ACT NORMAL.

00:05:06.726 --> 00:05:08.771
DO WHAT EVERYBODY ELSE
IS DOING.

00:05:08.815 --> 00:05:12.166
IF WE DO THAT, THEN, WITH A BIT
OF LUCK, WE'LL GET INSIDE.

00:05:12.209 --> 00:05:13.646
AND THEN...

00:05:13.689 --> 00:05:15.430
IT GETS REALLYTRICKY.CORRECT.

00:05:15.473 --> 00:05:16.779
YEAH.

00:05:16.823 --> 00:05:18.825
THIS IS COMPLETELY
MENTAL.

00:05:18.868 --> 00:05:20.087
COMPLETELY.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.741
THE WORLD'SMENTAL.

00:05:21.784 --> 00:05:23.699
COME ON.

00:05:23.743 --> 00:05:27.355
WE'VE GOT A HORCRUX
TO FIND.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.600
[ TOILETS FLUSHING ]

